 275:source\asw/main.c **** /**
 276:source\asw/main.c ****  * \brief Initialisation task: start the drivers, the application and the other tasks, then end.
 277:source\asw/main.c ****  *
 278:source\asw/main.c ****  * Runs once after StartOS(). The order of the calls matters (N1):
 279:source\asw/main.c ****  *   1. start the hardware drivers (UART log, sample timer component, LED, seven segment,
 280:source\asw/main.c ****  *      TFT, sound driver),
 281:source\asw/main.c ****  *   2. EE_system_init() - reconfigures the ISRs with the OS parameters,
 282:source\asw/main.c ****  *   3. MP3_Init() - scan the SD card, draw the TFT header,
 283:source\asw/main.c ****  *   4. start the alarms, activate the other tasks and terminate itself.
ARM GAS  C:\Users\agila\AppData\Local\Temp\cc1fL2w2.s 			page 12


 284:source\asw/main.c ****  *
 285:source\asw/main.c ****  * The return values of SOUND_Init() and MP3_Init() are not evaluated here (N2). After MP3_Init()
 286:source\asw/main.c ****  * a start message is written to the log and CEH_HASBOOTED is reported (N11).
 287:source\asw/main.c ****  *
 288:source\asw/main.c ****  * \note Runs only once. TerminateTask() is the last call.
 289:source\asw/main.c ****  */
