 471:source\asw/main.c **** /**
 472:source\asw/main.c ****  * \brief Button interrupt: turn the pressed buttons into events for tsk_control.
 473:source\asw/main.c ****  *
 474:source\asw/main.c ****  * Checks the four buttons and sets one event per pressed button (ev_Button1..ev_Button4).
 475:source\asw/main.c ****  * Several buttons pressed at the same time give several events. The events are handled
 476:source\asw/main.c ****  * in tsk_control (N4); the ISR itself does no work with the player.
 477:source\asw/main.c ****  *
 478:source\asw/main.c ****  * \note ISR category 2 (OS services allowed).
 479:source\asw/main.c ****  */
